#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:3
#: 8c3693eba98442aca31173406dbfadbd
msgid "层错路径（GSFE Path）"
msgstr "GSFE Path"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:5
#: 3cb2a041944c43819f38647a571fcce5
msgid "**分类：** 缺陷"
msgstr "**Category:** Defects"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:7
#: dbebc5bb8779470b8d8a5db7d3431775
msgid "功能说明"
msgstr "Purpose"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:9
#: b10f4589c02744ba8e25eb9a80838e4c
msgid ""
"在已经定向的输入晶胞中放置层间切面，并沿当前 `ab` 面内方向整体移动切面上方的原子，生成未弛豫的层错位移路径。卡片输出结构；路径能量需由后续 "
"DFT 或势函数计算。"
msgstr ""
"Place an interlayer cut in an already oriented input cell and rigidly "
"shift the atoms above it along an in-plane direction of the current `ab` "
"plane, generating an unrelaxed generalized stacking-fault displacement "
"path. The card outputs structures; path energies must be computed "
"afterward with DFT or an interatomic potential."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:11
#: 51c8e3b1e03b45019a87604b66e5f351
msgid "输入晶胞需要满足："
msgstr "The input cell must satisfy the following conditions:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:13
#: ab3b7a3dbd444d76afa15d610042166d
msgid "`a`、`b` 张成目标层错面；"
msgstr "`a` and `b` span the target fault plane;"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:14
#: f2d850d3e66749bfa06dd1ee874a7806
msgid "第三晶胞矢量 `c` 垂直于该面；"
msgstr "the third cell vector `c` is perpendicular to that plane;"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:15
#: 64f481d6aff04ddfbaae2de1e84bb189
msgid "原子沿面法向至少形成两个不同层。"
msgstr "atoms form at least two distinct layers along the plane normal."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:17
#: 6f4c4769d54248599a11f9f6772e922f
msgid ""
"原始体相中的 `(111)[11-2]` 不能直接照填。结构定向后，原始 `(111)` 面通常就是当前晶胞的 `(001)` "
"面，滑移方向也要换成当前 `a`、`b` 基矢下的系数。"
msgstr ""
"A bulk notation such as `(111)[11-2]` cannot be entered directly. After "
"orientation, the original `(111)` plane is usually the `(001)` plane of "
"the current cell, and the slip direction must also be converted to "
"coefficients in the current `a`, `b` basis."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:19
#: 0803549ee5444c4e953a94c450772a64
msgid "原理与公式"
msgstr "Principles and Equations"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:21
#: ee7a9b2779c44cdfa8d3ea80d5544417
msgid "界面输入的面内方向 `[u v]` 定义滑移向量"
msgstr ""
"The in-plane direction `[u v]` entered in the interface defines the slip "
"vector"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:23
#: 8598a553aa6b4aaaa8f1ef67aaea5e80
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\mathbf b_{\\mathrm{slip}}=u\\mathbf a+v\\mathbf b.\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:27
#: ac52091e74674db7b7f0096b9a87bd3b
msgid "“向量分数”模式下，路径值 $\\lambda$ 对应"
msgstr "In `Fraction of vector` mode, a path value $\\lambda$ corresponds to"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:29
#: 1589336ce4504fbfbcf2499fcf6fba30
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\Delta\\mathbf r=\\lambda\\mathbf b_{\\mathrm{slip}};\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:33
#: 81f7ed9f2b5247c6b4bc8066777c1aeb
msgid "“Å 距离”模式下，路径值 $d$ 对应"
msgstr "In `Å distance` mode, a path value $d$ corresponds to"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:35
#: a657041200c1470197bee1dd20fd56e4
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\Delta\\mathbf r=d\\frac{\\mathbf b_{\\mathrm{slip}}}{|\\mathbf "
"b_{\\mathrm{slip}}|}.\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:39
#: b679f42402fd48e0867dd266b8a12226
msgid ""
"程序根据所选切面得到移动集合，把其中每个原子加上同一位移，并为每个路径点生成一个结构。起点和终点均包含，step 必须为正。开启 wrap "
"时只沿周期方向把坐标折回晶胞。"
msgstr ""
"The program determines the moving set from the selected cut, adds the "
"same displacement to every atom in that set, and generates one structure "
"per path point. Both start and end are included, and the step must be "
"positive. When wrapping is enabled, coordinates are wrapped only along "
"periodic directions."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:41
#: 6761ccee00dc49f78d7f5eb6f3463403
msgid "若后续用能量差计算单界面 GSFE，需要另行使用"
msgstr ""
"To obtain a single-interface GSFE later from energy differences, apply "
"separately"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:43
#: 86b34972add44223bfd47206692d7a22
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\gamma(\\lambda)=\\frac{E(\\lambda)-E(0)}{n_{\\mathrm{interface}}A},\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:47
#: 9cc0ef0d9dc441d9bce91044e868fef5
msgid "其中 $A$ 是层错面面积，$n_{\\mathrm{interface}}$ 是周期结构中的等价界面数。"
msgstr ""
"where $A$ is the fault-plane area and $n_{\\mathrm{interface}}$ is the "
"number of equivalent interfaces in the periodic structure."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:49
#: e8e2cc82511941619d84033ad51afabe
msgid "操作示例"
msgstr "Example"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:51
#: a904f87ce33c426bb5a21846235490ba
msgid "fcc (111) 定向结构的完整周期路径"
msgstr "Complete Periodic Path for an Oriented fcc (111) Structure"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:53
#: 443a9030b78849a1b5e549e7cb56d0d4
msgid "假设上游已经把 fcc 晶体定向为：当前 `a`、`b` 位于原始 `(111)` 面内，`c` 垂直该面。"
msgstr ""
"Assume an upstream operation has oriented the fcc crystal so that the "
"current `a` and `b` lie in the original `(111)` plane and `c` is "
"perpendicular to it."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:55
#: 9177e91c8747465fb2b43c7b987c0d80
msgid "面内方向设为 `[1,0]`。"
msgstr "Set the in-plane direction to `[1,0]`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:56
#: 3972c20dcc90475fb6323991eff5dbb4
msgid "路径设为 `0 → 1，step 0.1`。"
msgstr "Set the path to `0 → 1` with a step of `0.1`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:57
#: cc4f11eaf1584ba9966b4d2c566ba2c0
msgid "单位选择“向量分数”。"
msgstr "Select `Fraction of vector` as the unit."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:58
#: 3a8d8153e5cc4cb888dfefabf2c35df4
msgid "切面选择“中间”。"
msgstr "Select `Middle` as the cut position."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:60
#: 8f591cd31f0448728b5be295b8d19f91
msgid ""
"若当前 `|a|=4 Å`，预览会显示 `0→1 向量 = 0→4 Å`，并生成 11 "
"个结构。完整一个周期向量的终点可能与起点周期等价，这是闭合位移路径的正常结果。"
msgstr ""
"If the current `|a|=4 Å`, the preview shows `0→1 vector = 0→4 Å` and "
"generates 11 structures. The endpoint of one complete periodic vector may"
" be periodically equivalent to the starting point; this is normal for a "
"closed displacement path."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:62
#: 6366ef9cefd74fa78af1000f88d23c19
msgid "若已知 Shockley partial 的实际位移长度，可把单位改成“Å 距离”，直接输入实际终点和步长。"
msgstr ""
"If the physical displacement length of a Shockley partial is known, "
"switch the unit to `Å distance` and enter the physical endpoint and step "
"directly."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:64
#: 464ab40c13934de99620922f41f063bf
msgid "参数说明"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:66
#: 611ae5bdd438454bbdb50d44a3055099
msgid "层错面（plane_hkl）"
msgstr "Fault Plane (plane_hkl)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:68
#: 6052dda8a91641228c7364a29e2104e5
msgid ""
"`Sequence[int]`，默认 `(0,0,1)`。新界面把当前晶胞的 `ab` 面固定作为层错面，因此该字段自动保存为 "
"`(001)`，不再要求用户重复填写。"
msgstr ""
"`Sequence[int]`, default `(0,0,1)`. The current interface fixes the `ab` "
"plane of the current cell as the fault plane, so this field is saved "
"automatically as `(001)` and the user no longer has to enter it again."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:70
#: ffeac2cd470d47b4b4033c3d0329e031
msgid ""
"旧工作流若保存了其他 `plane_hkl`，载入后会显示兼容提示并保持原值运行；编辑面内方向后切换到当前 `ab/(001)` "
"语义，不会静默改写载入时的结果。"
msgstr ""
"If an old workflow stores another `plane_hkl`, loading it displays a "
"compatibility notice and runs with the preserved value. Editing the in-"
"plane direction switches to the current `ab/(001)` semantics; the loaded "
"result is not silently rewritten beforehand."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:72
#: 5216e75b3a2c4240814a9a349311faf8
msgid "滑移方向（slip_uvw）"
msgstr "Slip Direction (slip_uvw)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:74
#: 52ace87b51ba466c9357aabcdb324a7c
msgid ""
"`Sequence[int]`，默认 `(1,0,0)`。新界面只输入 `[u,v]`，并保存为 `(u,v,0)`，真实向量为 `u*a + "
"v*b`。`[0,0]` 无法定义方向。"
msgstr ""
"`Sequence[int]`, default `(1,0,0)`. The current interface accepts only "
"`[u,v]` and saves it as `(u,v,0)`; the physical vector is `u*a + v*b`. "
"`[0,0]` does not define a direction."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:76
#: 1f3dc381dc774788a83da1dea411a719
msgid "旧配置中的非零 `w` 会在用户编辑方向前保持不变，并在界面显示兼容提示。"
msgstr ""
"A nonzero `w` from a legacy configuration is preserved until the user "
"edits the direction, and the interface displays a compatibility notice."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:78
#: 8d897e94049a4db2b50885dedea37344
msgid "位移路径（displacement_range）"
msgstr "Displacement Path (displacement_range)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:80
#: 7824ab52d37e40329fd6169ac97108bb
msgid ""
"`Sequence[float]`，默认 `(0.0,1.0,0.1)`，格式为 `[start,end,step]`，因此默认生成 11 "
"个路径点。起点和终点包含在输出中；step 必须大于 0。"
msgstr ""
"`Sequence[float]`, default `(0.0,1.0,0.1)`, in `[start,end,step]` form, "
"so the default produces 11 path points. Both start and end are included "
"in the output, and the step must be greater than zero."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:82
#: 8ac2d8fa73b4431f8f7ea0678e54e460
msgid "位移单位（displacement_unit）"
msgstr "displacement_unit"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:84
#: dcf42e0e5f0a4d8d972a099539e36e5c
msgid "`str`，默认 `fraction_of_vector`。"
msgstr "`str`, default `fraction_of_vector`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md
#: 144011e37c96410baac42e694a2464cc 23e3ef5c6b374bda99a13c73aa969e2a
msgid "选项"
msgstr "Option"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md
#: 1df096f564dc412b832122d58322cf35
msgid "路径值的含义"
msgstr "Meaning of Path Value"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md
#: b4ac57565d8248bc9ff1510927438dd6
msgid "`fraction_of_vector`"
msgstr "`fraction_of_vector`"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md
#: 811674678e064958955a2b7541fd9626
msgid "面内滑移向量的倍数"
msgstr "Multiple of the in-plane slip vector"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md
#: 20c3fe0d1557449b8d159a0868d53676
msgid "`angstrom`"
msgstr "`angstrom`"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md
#: 3983b399676b40eba32da9a6953311ea
msgid "沿滑移方向的实际 Å 距离"
msgstr "Physical distance in Å along the slip direction"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:91
#: 6a26ac4aff8d43c79f9dfa9e66238a90
msgid "预览会把向量分数同时换算成实际 Å 距离。"
msgstr "The preview also converts a vector fraction to its physical distance in Å."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:93
#: 7f7079f4d1fa44469a3de0e246470437
msgid "切面位置（cut_mode）"
msgstr "cut_mode"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:95
#: 6a855c58caa442c6a51add1743f3d10a
msgid "`str`，默认 `middle`。"
msgstr "`str`, default `middle`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md
#: d4d7633ad9ed4cd8ac8c68ff144a6fd7
msgid "计算方式"
msgstr "How It Is Computed"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md
#: d1bc5ab15aff46dd866b328b615ed3aa
msgid "`middle`"
msgstr "`middle`"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md
#: 3b61f4e25713461c91b4c22556a7220f
msgid "在结构中部相邻两层之间放置切面"
msgstr "Place the cut between two adjacent layers near the middle of the structure"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md
#: 3682685d215f47888a6759c24b52005e
msgid "`fractional`"
msgstr "`fractional`"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md
#: fb38959e90b84b119949d735fdccab07
msgid "按最低到最高投影层之间的厚度比例放置"
msgstr ""
"Place the cut at a fraction of the thickness between the lowest and "
"highest projected layers"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md
#: 2bf40011b3ce4b9c90d70693daafa173
msgid "`layer_index`"
msgstr "`layer_index`"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md
#: 6c836ee136ad42129a3498f8cc9042b1
msgid "在指定的下方层与下一层之间放置"
msgstr "Place the cut between the specified lower layer and the next layer"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:103
#: 66ae8e8abbde4f15943aa43a19227699
msgid "三种模式都要求切面两侧至少各有一个原子。"
msgstr "All three modes require at least one atom on each side of the cut."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:105
#: 92ee630567794666ad883402a61b4f42
msgid "厚度分数（cut_fraction）"
msgstr "cut_fraction"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:107
#: 8869340955d84ada8bd23240f3c9265e
msgid ""
"`float`，默认 `0.5`。仅在 `cut_mode=fractional` 时显示并生效；`0` 对应最低投影层，`1` "
"对应最高投影层。过于靠近边界而导致一侧没有原子时会报错。"
msgstr ""
"`float`, default `0.5`. Displayed and used only when "
"`cut_mode=fractional`; `0` corresponds to the lowest projected layer and "
"`1` to the highest. An error is reported if the cut lies so close to a "
"boundary that one side contains no atoms."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:109
#: f8e63eb0d76747549936359bae387175
msgid "下方层索引（layer_index）"
msgstr "Lower Layer Index (layer_index)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:111
#: 1d7c89c00a40415b99ac38b20a1b7485
msgid ""
"`int`，默认 `0`。仅在 `cut_mode=layer_index` 时显示并生效。索引从 0 "
"开始，切面位于该层和下一层之间，不能选择顶层。"
msgstr ""
"`int`, default `0`. Displayed and used only when `cut_mode=layer_index`. "
"Indices start at 0, and the cut is placed between the selected layer and "
"the next one; the top layer cannot be selected."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:113
#: 8a1cd46e80444b1a9009ec1353a85e93
msgid "包回晶胞（wrap）"
msgstr "Wrap into Cell (wrap)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:115
#: ffeef2c82e1a4cd2b449689b2075b25f
msgid "`bool`，默认 `true`。开启时沿周期方向把移动后的坐标折回晶胞；关闭时保留原始 Cartesian 位移，便于检查几何。"
msgstr ""
"`bool`, default `true`. When enabled, shifted coordinates are wrapped "
"into the cell along periodic directions. When disabled, the original "
"Cartesian displacement is retained for geometry inspection."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:117
#: e88fce086e974b3d8350dbd7cdf1ebe7
msgid "推荐组合"
msgstr "Recommended combinations"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:119
#: b45c6a2ffe3249e4a161f1462eb06046
#
msgid "`扩胞 → 层错路径`：先扩大面内周期，再生成层错路径。"
msgstr ""
"`Super Cell → GSFE Path`: enlarge the in-plane periodicity before "
"generating the fault path."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:120
#: eeb04a1cbca64bfc96bf169e249c3b16
msgid "`层错路径 → 原子扰动`：在理想路径点附近补充小幅热扰动。"
msgstr "`GSFE Path → Atomic Perturb`: add small thermal-like perturbations around ideal path points."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:121
#: 6a23181fadaa474da2734dd442dd9536
msgid "输出完成 DFT 单点后，比较能量曲线峰值、局部极小和路径对称性。"
msgstr ""
"After running DFT single-point calculations on the outputs, compare "
"peaks, local minima, and symmetry of the energy curve."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:123
#: 863c4eff72e4463d87a8735ee3e6edb8
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr "Troubleshooting"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:125
#: e1c1a2d236614ceb8972068570a58957
msgid "**为什么结构提示未定向？** 当前第三晶胞矢量必须垂直于 `ab` 层错面。先在上游完成晶胞定向。"
msgstr ""
"**Why is the structure reported as unoriented?** The third vector of the "
"current cell must be perpendicular to the `ab` fault plane. Orient the "
"cell upstream first."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:127
#: 553d026285144e62bbf7ba4a3d6f1d96
msgid "**为什么移动的不是预期层？** 切换到“层索引”，预览会显示解析后的切面位置以及移动、保留的原子数。"
msgstr ""
"**Why are the wrong layers moving?** Switch to `Layer index`; the preview"
" shows the resolved cut position and the numbers of shifted and "
"stationary atoms."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/strict-gsfe-path-card.md:129
#: 7f5ccb45607f479c92563af866ea8aa2
msgid "**为什么向量分数 1.0 的终点看起来回到起点？** 完整晶格滑移向量在周期边界下可以与起点等价。"
msgstr ""
"**Why does the endpoint at vector fraction 1.0 appear to return to the "
"start?** A complete lattice slip vector can be equivalent to the starting"
" point under periodic boundaries."

